{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n似顔絵会とお渡し会でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/3736653/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/3736653/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似顔絵会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たったかたほんとに\nおめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵はやっぱり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...下手でしたヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リベンジしたい｀・ω・´←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵描く時間もいれて\n5分くらい話せた(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"剥がしさんと\n戦いしなくても良かったし"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/3736653/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったし\nリベンジしたいし\nまたやりたいな(*゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/3736653/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/3736653/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お渡し会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は2部で\nせっちゃんとれなりんと一緒のレーン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真はせっちゃん\n袋はれなりん\nカレンダーは中田\nがお渡ししたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっちも\n抽選のイベだから\n来れた方おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日すっごい楽しかった！\nみんな来てくれてありがとう(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またカレンダーお渡ししたい←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、\n物販とか中田にやらせてくれれば\nそれでいいんだ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん\nほんっとに\n来てくれてほんとにありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日１日楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、もうひとつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の似顔絵会は\nゆみ姉の最後のイベントで\n乃木坂のメンバーとして活動するのも\n最後でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉、お疲れ様です\n今までお世話になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/3736653/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、アイドル界１のゲーマーは\nパズドラもやってるらしいから\nID教えてもらおっと(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、ゆみ姉\n本当に本当に好きなんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}